{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>灣仔一幢住宅大廈2024年7月3日發生致命意外，一名工人檢查一個住宅單位廁所內的照明設施時，懷疑從一把金屬梯具上墮下。該名工人頭部嚴重受傷，並於兩日後離世。涉事的​富城物業管理有限公司因違反《職業安全及健康條例》的規定，被勞工處檢控，今日（11日）在東區裁判法院被判罰款三萬元。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:57:33.291033+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:37.041227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:51:06.242392+00:00","content_hash":"5e0341d114b23aa7ce285e1d346ace0819771ebff99e099c2f9f99b10586bf4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:57:33.291033+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}